From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] msvcrt: Implement _getsystime and _setsystime.

_getsystime (fill a struct tm with the local time, return its milliseconds)
and _setsystime (set the local time from a struct tm and milliseconds,
return 0 or the system error) were spec stubs in crtdll, msvcrt, msvcrtd,
msvcr70 .. msvcr120 and ucrtbase (with its _o_ forms); msvcrt20/40
forward to msvcrt's.
